.TH man 1 "2026-06-08" "0.18.2" "Profanity XMPP client"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
/sendfile

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Send a file using XEP-0363 HTTP file transfer. If you are in an OMEMO session then the file will be encrypted (XEP-0454) as well.

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
/sendfile <file>

.LP

.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
\fB<file>\fR
.RS 4
Path to the file.
.RE

.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
/sendfile /etc/hosts

.LP
/sendfile ~/images/sweet_cat.jpg

.LP
